{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2023-02-07 06:30:00', 'title': 'STANDARD BARIATRICS, INC., NOW PART OF TELEFLEX, AWARDED BARIATRIC STAPLING TECHNOLOGY AGREEMENT WITH PREMIER INC.', 'text': 'WAYNE, PA., FEB. 07, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF MEDICAL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WAS AWARDED A GROUP PURCHASING ORGANIZATION (GPO) AGREEMENT WITH PREMIER®, INC. FOR THE TITAN SGS® POWERED STAPLING DEVICE, EXPANDING ACCESS TO THIS INNOVATIVE TECHNOLOGY FOR SURGEONS AFFILIATED WITH PREMIER.'}